0..72 Comment "// The twin of `model/desc/lc/subst-subst.gandr`\'s `substTwiceUnderLam`:"
73..146 Comment "// substitution whose lifting is a definition rather than the constructor"
147..222 Comment "// `Lift`. Two such substitutions at an abstraction unfold the outer one at"
223..300 Comment "// the inner one\'s stuck call beside the lifting call, and conversion refuses"
301..364 Comment "// the step (#761); with lifting a constructor it converts, and"
365..413 Comment "// `substSquare`\'s abstraction case rests on it."
